  "input": "What is the scheduler's dependency?\n[2026-01-12] standup/dune/2026-01-12: The scheduler remains a the Dune team service. [2025-02-13] standup/boreal/2025-02-13: The notifier calls the event-bus for delivery events, so treat the event-bus as a hard dependency of the notifier. Dependency map update: webhooks needs the event-bus (outbound events). [2025-05-15] standup/dune/2025-05-15-2: Reminder: the job scheduler is owned by Dune.",
